diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 31347ad..9d1e8ea 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -10,6 +10,11 @@ add up to it exactly:
     >>> split_amount(90, 3)
     [30, 30, 30]
 
+When the total does not divide evenly, the leftover cents go to the last parts, one cent each:
+
+    >>> split_amount(100, 3)
+    [33, 33, 34]
+
 `parts` must be at least 1 and the total must not be negative; anything else raises `ValueError`.
 
 ## Development
